=== F1: owner tokens keep every FR-10 separator ===
parse.ts OWNER regex now matches `-`, `_`, `.`, and `;` in an owner token.
ownerToken strips only trailing separators. `deferred:a;deploy` now parses to
a;deploy and gives Waits for Daniel with gate deploy and a Comment button.
`deferred:proof;delete` now gives deletion by the FR-10 priority order.
New tests in src/green-r2.test.ts cover each separator, the priority case,
and the Comment button on the resulting card.

=== F2: fixture reasons regenerated from the board code ===
mockup/fixtures.json state and reason fields were rebuilt by calling
classifyTrack over a synthetic TrackInput for every captured card. Zero open
cards now hold an empty reason. Seven new fixture cards add the missing gate
groups: deletion, paid spend, deploy, public date, sudo or login, proof, and
Thai check. The existing look group remains. All 739 Done cards keep their
baseline fields. New tests assert non-empty reasons, all eight gate groups,
and the Comment button on a gate card.

=== F3: Next in line names the current task ===
board.ts now computes nextLabel from the current task label when a current
task exists, and from the count note only when no current task exists.
New tests cover a Planned card and an In progress card with a current task,
plus a card with no current task that keeps the count note.

